[7.231, "o", "  1. \u001b[31;1mHIGH\u001b[0m  sensitive_correlation\r\n      id     : correlation_sex_target\r\n      column : sex\r\n      detail : Correlation score between sensitive column 'sex' and target 'target' is 0.500\r\n      measure: point_biserial |r| = 0.500   (n=8)\r\n\r\n  2. \u001b[31;1mHIGH\u001b[0m  demographic_parity_gap\r\n      id     : demographic_parity_sex_target\r\n      column : sex\r\n      detail : Demographic parity gap for 'sex' is 0.500 for target 'target'\r\n      rates  : F=0.25, M=0.75\r\n      spread : M leads F by 0.500\r\n\r\n\r\n\u001b[1m==========================================================================\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1mSTEP 4  \u00b7  Shareable markdown report\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1m==========================================================================\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u001b[0m\r\n# AuditLens statistical audit (Layer 1)\r\n\r\n- Rows: `8`\r\n- Columns: `4`\r\n"]
[8.931, "o", "- Target: `target`\r\n- Sensitive columns: `group, sex`\r\n\r\n## Summary\r\n\r\n- Total issues: `2`\r\n- High severity: `2`\r\n- Medium severity: `0`\r\n- Low severity: `0`\r\n\r\n## Findings\r\n\r\n### 1. `correlation_sex_target` (sensitive_correlation)\r\n\r\n- Severity: **HIGH**\r\n- Correlation score between sensitive column 'sex' and target 'target' is 0.500\r\n\r\n### 2. `demographic_parity_sex_target` (demographic_parity_gap)\r\n\r\n- Severity: **HIGH**\r\n- Demographic parity gap for 'sex' is 0.500 for target 'target'\r\n\r\n\r\n_Layer 2 interpretation was not run. Pass `task_description` to enable LLM-assisted reporting._\r\n\r\n\u001b[2m\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u001b[0m\r\n"]
